# On-Ramp Engine (VelaFi) – Process Task List

*Each task is broken into actionable subtasks. Check a sub-task when finished; only begin the next major task after all subtasks are complete.*

## 1. Backend API & Service Layer
- [ ] **services/velafi_client.py**
  - [ ] Wrap VelaFi endpoints: `add_payment_method`, `create_order`, `get_order`, `verify_signature`.
  - [ ] Implement retry & idempotency helpers.
- [ ] **routers/onramp.py**
  - [ ] `POST /onramp/payment_method` (uses `velafi_client.add_payment_method`).
  - [ ] `POST /onramp/order` (uses `velafi_client.create_order`).
  - [ ] Integrate `EnhancedSecurityService.is_deposit_allowed` pre-check.
  - [ ] Emit `order.status_changed` event on state transition.
- [ ] **routers/webhooks_velafi.py**
  - [ ] Validate `x-velafi-signature` (timestamp ±5 min, SHA-256).
  - [ ] Handle `order.completed` → trigger USDC credit via `BridgeAPIClient`.
  - [ ] Handle `order.failed` → log & surface error.
- [ ] **services/velafi_monitor.py**
  - [ ] Poll `pending/processing` orders every minute; reconcile & emit events.
- [ ] **Register new routers** in `clean_backend/main.py`.

